    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I hear you on the inclusivity part, but I guess I'm wondering about the \"confusion\" part you mentioned. Some of the more traditional employees are worried that this kind of thing actually makes things more awkward or even alienating for them because it feels like their views are being disregarded. How do you address that specific pushback?",
